# Real board photographs used as test data, and the labels made from them. Kept
# out of the repository: they are hundreds of megabytes, they are photographs of
# real games with people and score sheets in them, and the test suite is designed
# to need no image fixtures - tests that use these skip when the folder is absent.
/photos/
/photos_excluded/
/fixtures/
board-ui/.testphotos/

# The Protiles typeface. Same rule as the tile artwork above: it is someone else's
# work, it is read from a local copy, and it is not ours to redistribute. Measured as
# no help to reading anyway - see BACKLOG.md section 2.2.
_protiles.ttf
*.ttf
